OL,5,G1830 I'm Sorry I Haven't A Clue
OL,6,     F6/6. Jack Dee returns to Leeds
OL,7,     Fwith panellists Joe Lycett, Pippa
OL,8,     FEvans, Miles Jupp and Ian Smith
OL,9,     Ffor the final episode in series
OL,10,     F85.
OL,11,G1900 The Archers
OL,12,     FThere's a reunion for Fallon, and
OL,13,     FRex realises he may have put his
OL,14,     Ffoot in it.
OL,15,G2000 The Briefing Room
OL,16,     FWhy are fewer people are forming
OL,17,     Frelationships? There are all kinds
OL,18,     Fof theories about why this is
OL,19,     Fhappening. So what do we know
OL,20,     Fabout this noncoupling and its
OL,21,     Fimplications?
