OL,5,G2030 BBC Inside Science
OL,6,     FThe lab-created 'SpudCell' is
OL,7,     Farguably the most complete
OL,8,     Fsynthetic cell developed to date.
OL,9,     FBut is it really the turning point
OL,10,     Fin synthetic biology that some
OL,11,     Fpeople think?
